        {
          "text": "Mana abaana baDani nibeesinjisilia eshifwanani eshibaatse tsana; naye Yonatsani waGerishomu waMusa, nende abaanabe, nibaba abakuhani boluyia lwabaDani, okhuula khunyanga yobuhambe bweshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
